charge; action 5 fires the helmet laser in the facing direction. Dynamite destroys nearby walls
for 75 points but can kill R. Hero, while repeated laser shots cut walls without the wall award.
Laser or blast kills on spiders, bats, snakes, and moths award 50 points.

Later levels add a lava river and moving heat-resistant raft. Touching a critter or unprotected
lava, standing too near a blast, or exhausting power costs one of four lives. Reaching the trapped
miner awards 1,000 points, 50 per unused dynamite stick, and `remaining power × level`. A new life
is earned every 20,000 points. Rescue on level 20 completes the finite campaign.

