branches, climbs each screen's ladder layout, and uses a prepared super leap to cross broken-log
gaps before reaching Baby Kangaroo. The three screens repeat for three increasingly fast rounds.
The 2,000-point bonus timer falls by 20 per action; its remainder pays on rescue, while expiration
costs one of three lives.

Four monkeys chase Mother and generate eight finite apple attacks per screen. Low throws can be
jumped, high throws ducked, middle throws punched or jumped, and falling apples avoided or
punched. Action 5 punches adjacent monkeys for 200 points, thrown apples for 100, and falling
apples for 200. Three strawberries begin each screen at 100 points. A bell can be rung up to three
times; only fruit already collected is restored at the next value—tomato 200, cherries 400, then
pineapple 800—while uncollected fruit remains. Every 20,000 points awards a bonus life.

