falling and six thrown apples worth `2 × 200 + 6 × 100 = 1,000`. Adding the maximum 2,000 rescue
timer gives 8,300 per screen. Across three screens and three rounds,
`score_cap = 9 × 8,300 = 74,700`. Normalization is
